      "side": 1,
      "message": "Last week, Jack disabled some random debug messages: https://crrev.com/c/3630477.\n\nSo, if there\u0027s anything else like that, it could be a good candidate. You could disable PD logs, which would get us a fair bit of space, but it would also pretty much pre-abandon debugging a PD problem on volteer ever again.",
